SUMMARY:Giant Video Games & TGW Kickoff
LOCATION:Canada Malting Silos\, 9 Eireann Quay
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the beginning of Toronto Games Week outdoors at 
 the waterfront! Meet some new folks and get hyped for the big event at sun
 down: massive playable projected Toronto video games on the historic Canad
 a Malting Silos\, an arcade of locally made video games for you to explore
  and food stalls with marvellous snacks.  Made possible by Unity\, OCAD Un
 iversity and Interactive Ontario. Presented by the City of Toronto.\nPrice
 : Free\, just show up!\nRegistration: More info here.\nLink: https://www.t
 oronto.ca/explore-enjoy/festivals-events/video-game-month/?event_id=491b10
 6a-724e-4837-b514-3f0b87ed3c32&event_name=Giant%20Video%20Games%20%26%20To
 ronto%20Games%20Week%20Kickoff&calendar_date=2026-06-11T20:00:00-04:00\nMa
 p: P1 Express Park
URL:https://www.toronto.ca/explore-enjoy/festivals-events/video-game-month/
 ?event_id=491b106a-724e-4837-b514-3f0b87ed3c32&event_name=Giant%20Video%20
 Games%20%26%20Toronto%20Games%20Week%20Kickoff&calendar_date=2026-06-11T20
 :00:00-04:00
END:VEVENT
