DTSTAMP:20261127T033536Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T160000
SUMMARY:Intro to the Torontrons Workshop
LOCATION:U of T Bahen Centre\, 40 St. George St.
DESCRIPTION:Step inside the Torontrons\, Hand Eye Society’s custom arcade
  cabinets\, and learn how to get your game arcade-ready. This hands-on wor
 kshop introduces game developers to the Torontrons and shows them how to p
 repare their games for arcade-style exhibition.  Part of the <a href="http
 s://dmgregory.ca/tgw/">“Play Outside the Box”</a> event series.\nPrice
 : Free!\nRegistration: FULL. Waitlist here\nLink: https://www.eventbrite.c
 a/e/intro-to-the-torontrons-tickets-1987078720945?aff=ebdsoporgprofile\nMa
 p: 40 St George St
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/intro-to-the-torontrons-tickets-19870787209
 45?aff=ebdsoporgprofile
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:16667fc3c0eb4cf640910df14c12b09c35ee1d9b@torontogamesweek.com
DTSTAMP:20261127T033536Z
