SUMMARY:Rabbit.Hole.exe
LOCATION:Allan Gardens Children's Conservatory\, 160 Gerrard St. E.
DESCRIPTION:Jump into the rabbit hole and discover games from a city on the
  other side of the planet! Part game portal\, part digital playground\, an
 d part reflection of a city you call home. Rabbit.Hole.Exe brings together
  works from two cities — Toronto and Shenzhen —  through a curated web
 site featuring indie games\, interactive objects\, old websites\, and hidd
 en encounters inspired by early internet worlds and game culture. Access t
 he portal from our pop-up spots in both cities\, or log in from anywhere w
 ith an internet connection…if you have the key.\nDates/times: 16:00 - 21
 :00 CST (UTC+8)\nPrice: Free\, just show up!\nLink: rabbitholeexe.com\nMap
 : Allan Gardens Children's Conservatory
