SUMMARY:Curatorial Tour of Game On! at the Aga Khan Museum
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a guided curatorial tour of <a href="https://aga-kh
 an-museum-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/2026/03/Game-On_Aga-Khan-Museum_
 Press-Release_03.20.26_FINAL_V2.pdf">Game On!</a>\, a vibrant exhibition c
 elebrating the art\, culture\, and spirit of games through time. From boar
 d games to daring sports\, each piece invites you to explore how games con
