SUMMARY:Walkin' with Droqen... on the Island
LOCATION:Jack Layton Ferry Terminal\, 9 Queens Quay W.
DESCRIPTION:Come take a stroll & chat with other attendees in a relaxing na
 ture environment! We're going to arrive early for the 4:30 ferry to Hanlan
 's Point (don't be late or you'll miss it!)\, walk to Ward's Island\, and 
 - hopefully - get back right in time for the TGW Closing Party. Round trip
  ferry tickets are ~$10/adult. (P.S. Be prepared for 2-3 hours of walking\
 , with breaks.)\nPrice: Free\, just show up!\nMap: 9 Queens Quay West
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:963a767025d50288fbdbeb42100cf389fe307564@torontogamesweek.com
DTSTAMP:20261127T033536Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260617T235900
SUMMARY:TGW Closing Party
LOCATION:Demo Room\, 307 Lakeshore Blvd. E.
DESCRIPTION:Close out TGW 2026 with one final adventure\, with support from
  Interactive Ontario as part of their 25th Anniversary celebrations!  In a
 ddition to a 20 game retrospective for Toronto Game Jam's 20th year\, we h
 ave an awesome finale performance from HyperGame StoryTime -- but oh no\, 
 wait! The Bad Vibes Wizard has shown up to wreck our fun! He's trapped the
  various instruments needed to launch us into Party Time: can you help the
  Aerialist Angel free them? Or\, help out by making Dream Game drawings to
  attack the Bad Vibes Wizard and banish him for good! All these shenanigan
 s plus drinks\, music\, networking\, a game showcase in a Dirty RecRoom\, 
 and a raffle for a Nintendo Switch 2 provided by our joyful tech supporter
 s\, CrowdParty! (19+).\nPrice: $10-25.\nRegistration: Tickets required.\nL
 ink: https://luma.com/ccsakubc\nMap: 307 Lakeshore Blvd E
URL:https://luma.com/ccsakubc
END:VEVENT
